@page "/warranty-returns"

<PageTitle>Warranty &amp; Return Policy · JAS International</PageTitle>

<div class="shop-container py-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 block mb-2">ASSURANCE &amp; GUARANTEE</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2">Warranty &amp; Return Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Transparent protection for every device bought at JAS International</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. 7-Day Replacement Guarantee</h2>
            <p>
                Every brand-new smartphone, tablet, laptop, and audio device purchased from JAS International comes with an unconditional <strong>7-Day Replacement Guarantee</strong> for manufacturing hardware defects:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
                <li>Defect must be diagnosed as an out-of-the-box factory hardware malfunction (e.g. faulty display panel, microphone failure, charging port failure).</li>
                <li>Device must be in pristine cosmetic condition with all original box packaging, user manuals, warranty cards, and bundled accessories intact.</li>
                <li>Items exhibiting signs of accidental drops, physical cracks, water/liquid ingress, voltage spikes, or unauthorized repair attempts are void of replacement.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Official Brand Warranty</h2>
            <p>
                Products carrying official brand warranties (e.g. Apple, Samsung, Anker, Sony, Xiaomi, Asus, Lenovo) are supported by their designated national service centers in Bangladesh or through our Khulna showroom customer support desk. The specific warranty duration (e.g., 6 months, 1 year, 2 years) is clearly listed on each product's specification tab.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. How to File a Claim</h2>
            <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mt-3">
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-4">
                    <strong class="block text-slate-900 text-xs mb-1">Option A: In-Person Showroom Visit</strong>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                        Bring your gadget with original box and receipt to our showroom at <strong>Khulna Shopping Complex (3rd Floor)</strong> for same-day inspection.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-4">
                    <strong class="block text-slate-900 text-xs mb-1">Option B: Courier Return (Outside Khulna)</strong>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                        Contact our support team at <a href="tel:01711465078" class="text-blue-600 font-bold">01711465078</a> to obtain return authorization, then parcel the item securely via courier.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Refund Policy</h2>
            <p>
                In the event that an eligible defective item cannot be replaced due to permanent discontinued stock availability, JAS International will issue a 100% full refund through the customer's original payment method or bank/bKash transfer within 3 to 5 business days.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
